{#
   Live Telemetry (#telemetry) — the Boardroom Incident & Consequence Feed.

   Was _chairmans_terminal.html.twig, a widget in the right-hand column of the
   hero. The redesign promotes it to a full-bleed section of its own: the feed
   now needs a pause control, a four-tile stat strip and a per-line button
   target, none of which fits beside hero copy.

   Real, live data only (refreshed by app:telemetry:generate) — no illustrative
   filler. That constraint predates this redesign and still governs every line
   here. See LiveTelemetryService for exactly how each figure and each feed
   category is built; the short version:
     - fixturesSimulated / getCapitalDeployedFormatted() / getResultsFormatted() /
       activeClubs / weeksPlayed — aggregated from recent SyncRecord payloads.
       weeksPlayed is sync count * 4 (each sync ~= 4 on-device weekly ticks), an
       approximation rather than a true weeks-elapsed count.
     - totalGoals / getGoalsPerMatchFormatted() and promotions/relegations —
       pyramid-wide collective totals. Goals are summed from fixtures[]
       deduplicated by fixtureId, since each payload carries the syncing club's
       whole division's round and several clubs report the same fixtures. See
       TABLE TURNOVER below for the two turnover figures and their window.
     - recentEvents — up to 20 items across 10 real sources, selected round-robin
       (selectBalanced()) so a rare category can't be crowded out, then re-sorted
       newest-first. Each carries {time, text, category, categoryLabel, club,
       clubId, clubs, detail, amountExact, timestampIso, meta, trophy, dossier}.
       `trophy` is set only on CUP items.

   THREE STATES, per design/States.dc.html. The distinction that matters is
   "never generated" vs "generated and everything was zero" — a zero snapshot is
   a real, reportable state and must not read as a broken cron:
     - not generated: no row at all (getId() === null), so every figure is a
       default rather than a measurement. Tiles render as em-dashes, not zeros.
     - stale: generated, but longer ago than the cron's own cadence allows.
     - active: everything else.

   CUPS BAND. Between the stat strip and the feed, fed by CupTelemetryService
   (LandingController passes `cups`). Live cups with their current round, drawn
   fixtures and countdowns; a gold-ringed tile for any cup whose current round is
   the FINAL; open-for-entry progress; recent winners. Three states, decided by
   the service, not here:
     - cups is null        -> no band, no footer count: the terminal renders
                              exactly as it did before cups existed.
     - cups.live is empty  -> "CUPS // NONE LIVE", a one-line empty state and the
                              recent winners.
     - otherwise           -> the full band, finals sorted first.
   Timers are rendered as ISO `data-countdown-to` values and counted down by
   landing.js against the BROWSER's clock, so a viewer with a skewed clock sees a
   skewed timer. They stop at 00:00:00 rather than going negative: the round
   resolves on the next cron tick and the page is never re-fetched, so a negative
   number could only ever be a lie. `cup.timerAt` is nullable and every read of it
   is gated — Twig's `date` filter renders null as *now*, i.e. a countdown to zero.

   TABLE TURNOVER is two figures, promotions (▲) and relegations (▼), and is the
   one tile NOT on the 24h window. It stays on the feed's 7 days because a
   promotion lands only when a season concludes: across the SeasonRecord history
   on hand that happened on 33 of 55 days, so 24h would read ▲0 ▼0 about two days
   in five. Its sub-line says "7 days" where the other three say "24h" — the
   discrepancy is the honest reading, not an oversight.

   STALE_AFTER_SECONDS is 1800 here and in Api\TelemetryController, which is a
   duplicated constant: the API endpoint computes `stale` server-side, but this
   page is rendered from the entity directly (LandingController passes
   LiveTelemetryService::getSnapshot(), never a round trip to its own API) and
   the entity carries no staleness accessor. Keep the two numbers in step, or
   the page and the endpoint will disagree about the same snapshot.
#}
{% set telemetry_generated = telemetry.id is not null %}
{% set telemetry_age = 'now'|date('U') - telemetry.generatedAt|date('U') %}
{% set telemetry_stale = telemetry_generated and telemetry_age > 1800 %}
{% set telemetry_state = not telemetry_generated ? 'pending' : (telemetry_stale ? 'stale' : 'active') %}
{% set cups_live = cups is not null ? cups.live|length : 0 %}

<section class="telemetry-section" id="telemetry" aria-labelledby="telemetry-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="terminal is-{{ telemetry_state }}">
            <div class="terminal-header">
                <div class="terminal-header-live">
                    <span class="terminal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <h2 class="pixel terminal-title" id="telemetry-title">
                        {%- if telemetry_state == 'pending' -%}
                            TELEMETRY // AWAITING FIRST REFRESH
                        {%- elseif telemetry_state == 'stale' -%}
                            TELEMETRY // STALE SYNC
                        {%- else -%}
                            LIVE TELEMETRY // 24H PYRAMID FEED
                        {%- endif -%}
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <span class="terminal-sync vt">
                    {%- if telemetry_state == 'pending' -%}
                        SYNC: AWAITING FIRST REFRESH
                    {%- elseif telemetry_state == 'stale' -%}
                        SYNC: DELAYED [LAST REFRESH {{ telemetry.generatedAt|date('H:i') }}, {{ (telemetry_age / 60)|round(0, 'floor') }} MIN AGO]
                    {%- else -%}
                        SYNC: ACTIVE [REFRESHED {{ telemetry.generatedAt|date('H:i') }}]
                    {%- endif -%}
                </span>
            </div>

            {# Every tile is the snapshot's 24h window — the sub-line says so. #}
            <div class="terminal-stats">
                <div class="terminal-stat">
                    <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Fixtures &amp; Form</span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-val">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.fixturesSimulated|number_format : '—' }}</span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.getResultsFormatted() ~ ' (W-D-L), 24h' : 'No snapshot yet' }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal-stat">
                    <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Capital Deployed</span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-val is-mint">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.getCapitalDeployedFormatted() : '—' }}</span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">Transfers &amp; infra, 24h</span>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal-stat">
                    <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Goals Logged</span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-val is-gold">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.totalGoals|number_format : '—' }}</span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.getGoalsPerMatchFormatted() ~ ', 24h' : 'No snapshot yet' }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal-stat">
                    <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Table Turnover</span>
                    {# Split by direction. The arrow AND the colour AND the aria-label
                       all carry it, so colour is never the only cue. #}
                    <span class="terminal-turnover">
                        <span class="terminal-turnover-item" aria-label="{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.promotions : 'No' }} promoted">
                            <span class="terminal-arrow is-up" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="terminal-stat-val is-mint">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.promotions|number_format : '—' }}</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="terminal-turnover-item" aria-label="{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.relegations : 'No' }} relegated">
                            <span class="terminal-arrow is-down" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="terminal-stat-val is-red">{{ telemetry_generated ? telemetry.relegations|number_format : '—' }}</span>
                        </span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">Up · down, 7 days</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            {% if cups is not null %}
                <div class="tcup-head">
                    <div class="tcup-head-live">
                        <span class="tcup-dot{{ cups_live > 0 ? ' is-live' : '' }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <h3 class="pixel tcup-title">
                            {%- if cups_live > 0 or cups.open is not empty -%}
                                CUPS // {{ cups_live }} LIVE · {{ cups.open|length }} OPEN FOR ENTRY
                            {%- else -%}
                                CUPS // NONE LIVE
                            {%- endif -%}
                        </h3>
                    </div>
                    {% if cups.nextResultAt %}
                        <span class="tcup-next vt">NEXT RESULT IN <span data-countdown-to="{{ cups.nextResultAt|date('c') }}">—</span></span>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="tcup-body">
                    <div class="tcup-live">
                        {% if cups.live is empty and cups.open is empty %}
                            <p class="tcup-empty vt">
                                No cups in progress.
                                {% if cups.winners is not empty %}The last final was settled {{ cups.winners[0].ago }} — results stay here until the next one.{% endif %}
                            </p>
                        {% endif %}

                        {% for cup in cups.live %}
                            {% if cup.isFinal %}
                                <article class="tcup-final">
                                    <div class="tcup-final-head">
                                        <span class="tcup-final-chip pixel">FINAL</span>
                                        <span class="tcup-final-name pixel">{{ cup.name|upper }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                    {% set fx = cup.fixtures|first %}
                                    <div class="tcup-final-match">
                                        <div class="tcup-final-side" data-club-badge="{{ fx.home.badge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                                            <span class="tcup-badge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                            <span class="tcup-final-club">{{ fx.home.name }}</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="tcup-final-centre">
                                            <span class="tcup-trophy" data-trophy="{{ cup.trophy|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                            <span class="tcup-final-lbl vt">{{ cup.timerLabel }}</span>
                                            {% if cup.timerAt %}
                                                <span class="tcup-final-timer pixel" data-countdown-to="{{ cup.timerAt|date('c') }}">—</span>
                                            {% endif %}
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="tcup-final-side" data-club-badge="{{ fx.away.badge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                                            <span class="tcup-badge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                            <span class="tcup-final-club">{{ fx.away.name }}</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="tcup-foot vt">
                                        <span>{{ cup.capacity }} CLUBS ENTERED</span>
                                        {% if cup.prizePence > 0 %}<span class="tcup-gold">VICTOR'S PRIZE £{{ (cup.prizePence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            {% else %}
                                <article class="tcup-card">
                                    <div class="tcup-card-head">
                                        <span class="tcup-trophy" data-trophy="{{ cup.trophy|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                        <div class="tcup-card-id">
                                            <div class="tcup-card-name pixel">{{ cup.name|upper }}</div>
                                            <div class="tcup-card-meta vt">{{ cup.roundName }} · {{ cup.clubsLeft }} OF {{ cup.capacity }} LEFT</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="tcup-chip pixel">{{ cup.roundKey }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                    {% for fx in cup.fixtures %}
                                        <div class="tcup-fx">
                                            <span class="tcup-badge tcup-badge--only" data-club-badge="{{ fx.home.badge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                            <span class="tcup-fx-abbr pixel" title="{{ fx.home.name }}">{{ fx.home.abbr }}</span>
                                            <span class="tcup-fx-v vt">v</span>
                                            <span class="tcup-fx-abbr tcup-fx-abbr--away pixel" title="{{ fx.away.name }}">{{ fx.away.abbr }}</span>
                                            <span class="tcup-badge tcup-badge--only" data-club-badge="{{ fx.away.badge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                        </div>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                    {% if cup.timerAt %}
                                        <div class="tcup-foot vt">
                                            <span>{{ cup.timerLabel }}</span>
                                            <span class="tcup-mint" data-countdown-to="{{ cup.timerAt|date('c') }}">—</span>
                                        </div>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </article>
                            {% endif %}
                        {% endfor %}

                        {% for cup in cups.open %}
                            <article class="tcup-card">
                                <div class="tcup-card-head">
                                    <span class="tcup-trophy" data-trophy="{{ cup.trophy|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    <div class="tcup-card-id">
                                        <div class="tcup-card-name pixel">{{ cup.name|upper }}</div>
                                        <div class="tcup-card-meta vt">{{ cup.capacity }} CLUBS{% if cup.entryFeePence > 0 %} · ENTRY £{{ (cup.entryFeePence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}{% endif %}</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="tcup-chip tcup-chip--open pixel">OPEN</span>
                                </div>
                                {# capacity is an admin-editable IntegerField, so it is divided
                                   by only after checking — a 0 would be a Twig division error
                                   that takes the whole landing page down, not a broken bar. #}
                                <div class="tcup-bar" role="img" aria-label="{{ cup.entered }} of {{ cup.capacity }} entered">
                                    <span class="tcup-bar-fill" style="width:{{ cup.capacity > 0 ? (cup.entered / cup.capacity * 100)|round(1) : 0 }}%"></span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="tcup-card-meta vt">{{ cup.entered }} OF {{ cup.capacity }} ENTERED · DRAW WHEN FULL</div>
                                {% if cup.prizePence > 0 %}
                                    <div class="tcup-foot vt">
                                        <span>WINNER TAKES</span>
                                        <span class="tcup-mint">£{{ (cup.prizePence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}
                            </article>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>

                    {% if cups.winners is not empty %}
                        <aside class="tcup-winners">
                            <div class="tcup-winners-title pixel">RECENT WINNERS</div>
                            <ol class="tcup-winners-list">
                                {% for w in cups.winners %}
                                    <li class="tcup-winner" data-club-badge="{{ w.badge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                                        <span class="tcup-trophy tcup-trophy--sm" data-trophy="{{ w.trophy|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                        <span class="tcup-badge tcup-badge--only" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                        <span class="tcup-winner-text">
                                            <span class="tcup-winner-club">{{ w.clubName }}</span>
                                            <span class="tcup-winner-line vt">{{ w.cupName|upper }} · {{ w.ago }}</span>
                                        </span>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ol>
                            <a href="#cup-results" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm pixel">ALL CUP RESULTS</a>
                        </aside>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="terminal-body{{ cups is not null ? ' terminal-body--after-cups' : '' }}">
                <ul class="terminal-feed" aria-label="Recent pyramid activity">
                    {% for event in telemetry.recentEvents %}
                        <li class="terminal-feed-row">
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="terminal-feed-item{{ loop.first ? ' active' }} vt cat-{{ event.category|lower }}"
                                    data-category-label="{{ event.categoryLabel }}"
                                    data-club="{{ event.club }}"
                                    data-detail="{{ event.detail }}"
                                    data-amount="{{ event.amountExact }}"
                                    data-timestamp="{{ event.timestampIso }}"
                                    data-meta="{{ event.meta|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
                                    data-club-badge="{{ event.clubBadge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
                                    data-dossier="{{ event.dossier|default(null)|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                                <span class="terminal-feed-category pixel">{{ event.categoryLabel }}</span>
                                <span class="terminal-feed-line">
                                    {# NEW: cup events carry the cup's TrophyConfig in event.trophy. #}
                                    {% if event.trophy|default(null) %}
                                        <span class="terminal-feed-trophy" data-trophy="{{ event.trophy|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                    {% for named in event.clubs|default([]) %}
                                        {% if named.badge %}
                                            <span class="terminal-feed-badge"
                                                  data-club-badge="{{ named.badge|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
                                                  aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    {% endfor %}
                                    <span class="terminal-feed-time">[{{ event.time }}]</span> {{ event.text }}
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </li>
                    {% else %}
                        <li class="terminal-feed-row">
                            <p class="terminal-feed-empty vt">
                                {%- if telemetry_generated -%}
                                    No activity to report in the last 24 hours.
                                {%- else -%}
                                    No activity to report yet. The first snapshot lands within 15 minutes of the next refresh.
                                {%- endif -%}
                            </p>
                        </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>

                <div class="terminal-aside">
                    <div>
                        <div class="terminal-aside-title pixel">INCIDENT REPORT</div>
                        <p class="terminal-aside-copy">Select any line to open the boardroom dossier: the club's badge and kit, the logged time, the value, its best-rated player and its latest fixtures.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="terminal-aside-actions">
                        {% if telemetry.recentEvents|length > 1 %}
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm pixel" id="telemetry-pause" aria-pressed="false">PAUSE FEED</button>
                        {% endif %}
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-gold btn-sm pixel" id="terminal-cta">ENTER BOARDROOM</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="terminal-footer vt">
                {% if telemetry_generated %}
                    {{ telemetry.activeClubs|number_format }} ACTIVE CLUBS // ~{{ telemetry.weeksPlayed|number_format }} WEEKS PLAYED (ESTIMATE)
                    {%- if cups_live > 0 %} // {{ cups_live }} {{ cups_live == 1 ? 'CUP' : 'CUPS' }} LIVE{% endif %} // OFFLINE-FIRST ENGINE.
                    Results are tallied from the last five matches per sync, so a club that syncs often can be counted twice.
                {% else %}
                    OFFLINE-FIRST ENGINE. Figures appear once the first snapshot is generated.
                {% endif %}
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
